<p>
  <.link navigate="/me">My workspace</.link>
  is your own corner of Zippiker: everything about you as an employee, in one place.
</p>
<ul>
  <li>
    <strong>Overview</strong>: leave balances, upcoming time off, your expense claims and shortcuts to request leave, claim expenses or claim leave days.
  </li>
  <li>
    <strong>My tasks</strong>: onboarding and offboarding tasks assigned to you (for example, read and sign the staff handbook). Open one to attach a file and mark it done.
  </li>
  <li>
    <strong>My profile</strong>: keep your phone and emergency contact up to date. Your job details are maintained by HR.
  </li>
</ul>
<.callout>
  My workspace needs your login to be linked to your employee record. If you see “No employee record
  yet”, ask an admin to link it under People → Employees.
</.callout>
